    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-6-2",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod6-Q2",
        "itemBody": "<p>An analyst determines that stocks have an expected return of 10% with a standard deviation of 15% and bonds have an expected return of 6% with a standard deviation of 9%. The correlation between stocks and bonds is 0.6. An equally weighted portfolio of stocks and bonds would have a standard deviation (square root of variance) of:</p>",
        "feedback": {
          "neutral": ""
        },
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "65740d34-a489-49f5-ac79-5b3ee4609295",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. less than 12%.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "2d769349-417f-4f63-8f97-c77e62664e37",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. equal to 12%.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "9f7c8c35-9fea-49da-8950-ff885b4b1cd6",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. greater than 12%.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "65740d34-a489-49f5-ac79-5b3ee4609295"
        },
        "properties": {
          "shuffleRules": {
            "choices": {
              "toLock": [],
              "shuffled": false
            }
          }
        },
        "scoringAlgorithm": "Equivalence",
        "interactionTypeSlug": "choice"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2027-Quan-6-3",
      "entry": {
        "title": "2027 Quantitative Methods Mod6-Q3",
        "itemBody": "<p>An asset is currently valued at USD50. In any given period, it can increase in value by 10% with a probability of 0.55 or decline in value by 8% with a probability of 0.45. At Time 0, the expected price at the end of two periods is closest to:</p>",
        "feedback": {
          "neutral": ""
        },
        "interactionData": {
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "587426db-4cec-477c-addf-a6c36281c7d3",
              "itemBody": "<p>A. 39.39.</p>",
              "position": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "52c23b80-ddaf-4e7e-b4b3-46e29761e0d0",
              "itemBody": "<p>B. 50.10.</p>",
              "position": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "87843241-2f1a-41d9-a1ef-dc9976630102",
              "itemBody": "<p>C. 51.92.</p>",
              "position": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        "scoringData": {
          "value": "587426db-4cec-477c-addf-a6c36281c7d3"
        },
        "properties": {
          "shuffleRules": {
            "choices": {
              "toLock": [],
              "shuffled": false
            }
          }
        },
        "scoringAlgorithm": "Equivalence",
        "interactionTypeSlug": "choice"
      }
